<title>USA: Ascent names president/CEO as chairman.</title>
<headline>Ascent names president/CEO as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascent Entertainment Group Inc said Monday it has named President and Chief Executive Charlie Lyons to the chairman's post.</p>
<p>Lyons succeeds Chairman Robert Schwartz, who had been appointed by Comsat Corp and resigned Friday along with three other Comsat appointees in connection with Ascent's spin-off from Comsat.</p>
<p>Ascent provides pay-per-view entertainment and information services.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
